        "main_content": [
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Find Out More Find Out More"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h5",
            "text": "Flagship Product"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h1",
            "text": "Bare Metal Cloud"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Deploy automation-driven dedicated servers globally in minutes via API, CLI, or WebUI."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Next-gen hardware. 50 Gbps network. Scale-out storage. Flexible billing. 15 TB Free bandwidth."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Deploy in Minutes Deploy in Minutes"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h5",
            "text": "Trusted by:"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h5",
            "text": "Products and Services"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h2",
            "text": "A Broad Data Center-as-a-Service Portfolio"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "From power, space, and cooling to workload-optimized systems, we offer performance, security, and availability-focused products and services suitable for businesses of all sizes."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Watch Video Presentation"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Schedule a Virtual Data Center Tour"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h4",
            "text": "Colocation"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Leverage redundant and secure systems, high-density deployments, and services spanning from ¼ cabinets to private cages. Lease next-gen hardware or customizable dedicated servers to scale your infrastructure with ease."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h4",
            "text": "Bare Metal Cloud"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Provision anything from sandboxes to production environments in a few clicks or API calls. Choose from 50+ pre-configured dedicated server instances, deploy a server in minutes, consume it as cloud, and manage it as code."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h4",
            "text": "Enterprise-Grade Network"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Ensure seamless delivery of your services. Access Tier 1 carriers at each data center location and provide your business with high-bandwidth connectivity, enterprise-grade security, and exceptional data transfer performance."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h4",
            "text": "Cloud On-Ramps"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Host your IT and workloads at Arizona’s first AWS Direct Connect and Google Cloud Interconnect location. Effortlessly access 3rd party CSPs via Megaport Cloud Router and build a robust hybrid cloud with minimal investments."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h4",
            "text": "Backup and DR"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Easily build your availability infrastructure with best-in-class cloud backup and disaster recovery solutions. Use disaster-free Phoenix location as your target, or back up and mirror data to any of phoenixNAP’s global data center locations."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h4",
            "text": "Alternative Cloud Portfolio"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Avoid high costs, vendor lock-in, and poor performance of hyperscale public cloud solutions. Combine cloud-smart IT infrastructure services and cost-effectively build high-performance environments tailored to your needs."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h5",
            "text": "Superior Connectivity Options"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h2",
            "text": "Global Network Footprint"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Take advantage of phoenixNAP’s global data center presence and 9+ Tbps network backbone. Access full-service, opex-modeled offerings tailored to your performance, location, and security requirements."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "15+ Data Centers and Network PoPs 9 +Tbps Connectivity 5 Continents AWS Direct Connect Google Cloud Interconnect Access To Other Hyperscalers Strength in Partnerships Alliance with the Best in Business We take pride in our partnerships. With longstanding alliances with some of the biggest names in IT, phoenixNAP can offer you limitless hardware and software resources to facilitate your success."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h5",
            "text": "Ready to get started?"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h2",
            "text": "Connect with phoenixNAP"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Get in touch with a phoenixNAP solution expert or sales representative to find out more about our services and discover which one is the perfect fit for your specific business needs. Learn more about our broad service portfolio, request a quote, or get all the help you need to start."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Contact Us &nbsp;»"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h5",
            "text": "Partner. Grow. Exceed."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h2",
            "text": "Become a Partner"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Quickly tap into new revenue streams and offer enterprise-grade IaaS services to your clients. Access all the necessary tools, go-to-market resources, training, and knowledge from a global data center service provider and grow your business to new heights."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Join the Partner Program &nbsp;»"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h5",
            "text": "phoenixNAP Blog and Knowledge Base"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h2",
            "text": "Our Latest Articles and Tutorials"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Discover the latest insights and trends in our comprehensive articles and tutorials section. Stay ahead of the curve with in-depth analysis, expert tips, and step-by-step guides, designed to fuel your curiosity and enhance your expertise."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "NEWSLETTER"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h4",
            "text": "Subscribe to Our Newsletter"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Regulary receive all the latest updates and news from phoenixNAP."
          },
          {
